displayName: "From The Void: Project Altrat"
name: "pa"
author: "Altrat Team"
description:
  "Welcome to the Project: Altrat!
  The mod will add the planet Altrat to the game, a planet that has been plunged into darness and pain over the centuries of war. Your goal is to rekindle it and restore its former glory.
  
  _   _   _   _   _   _   _
  
  
  My first full-fledged mod makes a significant contribution to the expansion of game content by adding a new planet. Despite potential technical errors or flaws. I am sure that this mod will enrich the user's gaming experience. I would appreciate any feedback that will help improve the quality of the mod.
  It's hjson mod!
  
  Authors:
    Sprites, maps, hosting - TEA
    Code, scripts, tedting - SKYPETR
    
  Special Thanks:
    Bloody Ocean
    Falay
    ACE
    Octium
    Codex"
version: "0.1.0"
minGameVersion: 158.1